  "id": "MttSWS",
  "name": "Progressive Lightmap Render",
  "author": "huwb",
  "description": "Accumulates diffuse-only GI into a lightmap for the scene. Gathers radiance in UV space - rays cast for each lightmap texel, accumulated over time. Move light with mouse, scene converges when light is stationary.",
